          "cells": [
            {
              "id": "understand-0",
              "row": 0,
              "column": 0,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "heading",
                  "text": "OWNERSHIP IS THE FIRST CONSTRAINT",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 12,
                  "bold": true,
                  "foreground": "#FFFFFF",
                  "align": "left",
                  "min_height_pt": 31
                }
              ],
              "padding": {
                "top": 8,
                "right": 10,
                "bottom": 7,
                "left": 10
              },
              "background": "#070154"
            },
            {
              "id": "understand-1",
              "row": 1,
              "column": 0,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "mechanism",
                  "text": "A portal replacement would leave manual exceptions, duplicate case state, and difficult audit reconstruction in place. Four teams currently exchange status in spreadsheets across three downstream systems.",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 10.5,
                  "foreground": "#070154",
                  "align": "left",
                  "min_height_pt": 83
                },
                {
                  "id": "boundary",
                  "text": "Establish one case identifier, accountable owners, and explicit escalation paths. Keep alternate intake routes available while discovery confirms where rework and decision delays occur.",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 10.5,
                  "foreground": "#070154",
                  "align": "left",
                  "gap_before_pt": 7,
                  "min_height_pt": 73
                }
              ],
              "padding": {
                "top": 8,
                "right": 10,
                "bottom": 7,
                "left": 10
              },
              "background": "#E8EEF8"
            },
            {
              "id": "understand-2",
              "row": 2,
              "column": 0,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "evidence-label",
                  "text": "Evidence to collect",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 10.5,
                  "bold": true,
                  "foreground": "#070154",
                  "align": "left",
                  "min_height_pt": 14
                },
                {
                  "id": "evidence",
                  "text": "A sampled baseline, journey and ownership map, and interface/dependency register. The assumed rates above are not an independently validated business case.",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 10,
                  "foreground": "#070154",
                  "align": "left",
                  "gap_before_pt": 3,
                  "min_height_pt": 56
                }
              ],
              "padding": {
                "top": 8,
                "right": 10,
                "bottom": 7,
                "left": 10
              },
              "background": "#FFFFFF"
            },
            {
              "id": "prove-0",
              "row": 0,
              "column": 1,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "heading",
                  "text": "PROVE A COMPLETE, BOUNDED JOURNEY",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 12,
                  "bold": true,
                  "foreground": "#FFFFFF",
                  "align": "left",
                  "min_height_pt": 31
                }
              ],
              "padding": {
                "top": 8,
                "right": 10,
                "bottom": 7,
                "left": 10
              },
              "background": "#070154"
            },
            {
              "id": "prove-1",
              "row": 1,
              "column": 1,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "mechanism",
                  "text": "Select one thin release that connects reliable intake, a visible service queue, a supported integration, and an auditable case history. Include exceptions, access controls, and operational telemetry in the first proof.",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 10.5,
                  "foreground": "#070154",
                  "align": "left",
                  "min_height_pt": 83
                },
                {
                  "id": "boundary",
                  "text": "Existing processing systems retain transaction ownership. Versioned interfaces and event contracts connect the journey; real-time updates and platform consolidation are not assumed.",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 10.5,
                  "foreground": "#070154",
                  "align": "left",
                  "gap_before_pt": 7,
                  "min_height_pt": 73
                }
              ],
              "padding": {
                "top": 8,
                "right": 10,
                "bottom": 7,
                "left": 10
              },
              "background": "#E8EEF8"
            },
            {
              "id": "prove-2",
              "row": 2,
              "column": 1,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "evidence-label",
                  "text": "Evidence to produce",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 10.5,
                  "bold": true,
                  "foreground": "#070154",
                  "align": "left",
                  "min_height_pt": 14
                },
                {
                  "id": "evidence",
                  "text": "A prioritized backlog, agreed acceptance measures, test results, control findings, and working runbooks. Additional journeys and integrations require separate scope decisions.",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 10,
                  "foreground": "#070154",
                  "align": "left",
                  "gap_before_pt": 3,
                  "min_height_pt": 56
                }
              ],
              "padding": {
                "top": 8,
                "right": 10,
                "bottom": 7,
                "left": 10
              },
              "background": "#FFFFFF"
            },
            {
              "id": "decide-0",
              "row": 0,
              "column": 2,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "heading",
                  "text": "EXPAND WHEN THE EVIDENCE SUPPORTS IT",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 12,
                  "bold": true,
                  "foreground": "#FFFFFF",
                  "align": "left",
                  "min_height_pt": 31
                }
              ],
              "padding": {
                "top": 8,
                "right": 10,
                "bottom": 7,
                "left": 10
              },
              "background": "#070154"
            },
            {
              "id": "decide-1",
              "row": 1,
              "column": 2,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "mechanism",
                  "text": "Authorize four weeks of discovery and first-release definition, subject to access readiness and agreement on acceptance measures. Use the results to confirm the release scope, dependencies, and delivery sequence.",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 10.5,
                  "foreground": "#070154",
                  "align": "left",
                  "min_height_pt": 83
                },
                {
                  "id": "boundary",
                  "text": "Pilot readiness requires accepted test evidence, resolved critical control findings, executable runbooks, and a rehearsed rollback. Weak evidence or changed conditions trigger a scope adjustment.",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 10.5,
                  "foreground": "#070154",
                  "align": "left",
                  "gap_before_pt": 7,
                  "min_height_pt": 73
                }
              ],
              "padding": {
                "top": 8,
                "right": 10,
                "bottom": 7,
                "left": 10
              },
              "background": "#E8EEF8"
            },
            {
              "id": "decide-2",
              "row": 2,
              "column": 2,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "evidence-label",
                  "text": "Decision to make",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 10.5,
                  "bold": true,
                  "foreground": "#070154",
                  "align": "left",
                  "min_height_pt": 14
                },
                {
                  "id": "evidence",
                  "text": "Proceed, hold, or adjust at explicit steering gates. The 20-week sequence is illustrative; named staffing, allocations, availability, commercial terms, and dates remain to be agreed.",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 10,
                  "foreground": "#070154",
                  "align": "left",
                  "gap_before_pt": 3,
                  "min_height_pt": 56
                }
              ],
              "padding": {
                "top": 8,
                "right": 10,
                "bottom": 7,
                "left": 10
              },
              "background": "#FFFFFF"
            }
          ]
        }
